        ],
        "summary": "Get the complete list of all initial settings.",
        "description": "This operation is responsible for obtaining all configurations registered. For valid response try sending the filters as query params, a string value with param name 'crPlace', a string value with param name 'crStore',a string value with param name 'numDevice' anything diferent type from values will generate API errors.",
